                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُوَّةٌ</span></b> 
                         and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَوَّةٌ</span> (S, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَوٌّ</span> (K) <i>A
